% === third-party packages ==============================================
% `@types/react` is the #58 case: the indexer attributes a DefinitelyTyped
% symbol to the types package, and the source imports `react`. Both rows are
% true and neither converts into the other.
extern("scip cargo serde 1.0.0 serde/Serialize#", "cargo", "serde", "1.0.0").
extern("scip cargo serde 1.0.0 serde/Deserialize#", "cargo", "serde", "1.0.0").
